{"id":"644927","name":"玉米牛肉蒸饭","author":"_蒍鉨变乖々","authorId":"8010238","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/644927/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"牛肉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"玉米","amount":"适量"},{"name":"胡萝卜","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"葱花","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"胡萝卜洗净去皮切小丁备用。","img":"images/644927/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"玉米粒剥出后洗净。","img":"images/644927/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"牛肉洗净切薄片。","img":"images/644927/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"加入适量生抽，蚝油，玉米淀粉，花生油。","img":"images/644927/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"将牛肉抓拌均匀备用。","img":"images/644927/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"碗中大米清洗干净。","img":"images/644927/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"加入玉米和胡萝卜。","img":"images/644927/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"加入适量盐和花生油拌匀。","img":"images/644927/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"加入适量清水，锅中加入水。","img":"images/644927/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"大火蒸30分钟左右。","img":"images/644927/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"蒸至大米断生。","img":"images/644927/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"将牛肉均匀铺在米饭上。","img":"images/644927/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"继续大火蒸至牛肉变色断生。","img":"images/644927/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"出锅前淋入少许味极鲜，洒上葱花即可。","img":"images/644927/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/644927/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/644927/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/644927/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/644927/step_18.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}